 b the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a 
 place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aft
 ermath of their visits\, one night he's left with a major problem to solve
 .\n\nTickets: https://tickets.thecinemagictheater.com/checkout/showing/the
